://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/deployments","created_at":"2026-08-05T16:00:07Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T17:31:44Z","pushed_at":"2026-09-23T18:02:56Z","git_url":"git://github.com/Agent-Field/CodeAF.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:Agent-Field/CodeAF.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/Agent-Field/CodeAF.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/Agent-Field/CodeAF","homepage":"http://agentfield.ai/","size":196153,"stargazers_count":116,"watchers_count":116,"language":"Go","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":14,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":141,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["agent-fleet","agent-harness","agentfield","agentic-coding","ai","ai-coding","cli-agent","coding-agent","coding-agents","coding-assistant","coding-cli","coding-harness","developer-tools","harness","harness-engineering","llm","open-models","open-source-models","software-factory","terminal-agent"],"visibility":"public","forks":14,"open_issues":141,"watchers":116,"default_branch":"dev","permissions":{"admin":true,"maintain":true,"push":true,"triage":true,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/pulls/1382","html_url":"https://github.com/Agent-Field/CodeAF/pull/1382","diff_url":"https://github.com/Agent-Field/CodeAF/pull/1382.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Agent-Field/CodeAF/pull/1382.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-22T13:49:28Z"},"body":"Fixes #1379.\n\nA person with eighty-one SKILL.md folders on disk asked the chat whether it could use skills and was told codeaf has no such mechanism. The binary carried the wave. `memory.enabled` was off.\n\nEvery part behaved as designed. The launch import returns when memory is nil, the catalog renders zero bytes for an empty shelf, and `use_skill` is withheld rather than present and refusing. The model was left with no shelf, no verb and no sentence about either, so it reasoned from the silence and denied a shipped feature.\n\n## The rule this adds\n\nAbsent-not-broken stops a model planning a reply around a call that can only refuse. It does not stop a model reasoning from the absence. So it gets a companion clause rather than an exception: **when a capability is withheld by a setting, something has to say so.**\n\nOtherwise \"absent because impossible here\" and \"absent because it does not exist\" are the same silence.\n\n## What changed\n\n- The catalog renders one line when the machine holds skills this session cannot reach, naming `memory.enabled` and saying the skills exist.\n- The door measures that once at launch. A prompt prefix may not walk six folders per render.\n- A machine with no skills still pays nothing. That is what the emptiness law is actually about: a number nobody has yet, not the difference between empty and switched off.\n- The `/skill` picker reads the folders rather than the shelf, so it listed skills that could not be attached. Each row now carries the reason **beside** the folder's own warning rather than instead of it.\n- `use-skill.md` gains a heading answering the capability question in both states.\n\n## Proof\n\nBoth new tests were run **red against the unfixed tree** before they were kept:\n\n```\n--- FAIL: TestTheCatalogSaysSkillsAreSwitchedOffRatherThanMissing\n    a machine with skills and memory off rendered nothing\n--- FAIL: TestTheSkillPickerSaysWhyARowCannotBeAttachedWithMemoryOff\n    the row does not say why choosing it does nothing:\n    › ○ alpha-flake      chase a flaky test · project\n```\n\nGate on the build box at `410fea62b`:\n\n```\ngofmt clean   build 0   vet 0   change entries 107   laws 0   manual gates 0\ninternal/session  ok  (full package)\ninternal/tui3     ok  325.396s\ncmd/codeaf        ok   93.272s\n```\n\n## Not in this\n\n#1378 is the manual retrieval side: no probe in the corpus asks the capability question. This adds the page's heading; making it reachable is that issue's acceptance and its own change.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/1382/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/1382/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":31697880604,"node_id":"LE_lADOTu5AHM8AAAABSjdZIs8AAAAHYVdGHA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/events/31697880604","actor":{"login":"santoshkumarradha","id":29346072,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MzQ2MDcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29346072?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha","html_url":"https://github.com/santoshkumarradha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/